Origin: EmberBSD, AI-assisted.
The export keeps only lang/ruby40 (pkgsrc/versions.mk), but the pinned
rubyversion.mk still defaulted to Ruby 3.4 and accepted 3.3 and 3.4, so a
build without its own Ruby selection (the Darwin bootstrap, the shells
profile) picked the removed ruby34. Ruby 4.0 is the only supported,
accepted and default version; the 3.3 and 3.4 data is gone.
Not submitted upstream.

